# covers: 3 E4.2, 3 E4.6, 3 E6.7
# fixture: phase3-pvp
# Companion role; reports retained separately; coordination through received state only.
# A1 tick100ms; actor allowance30s *3=90s; delivery1s *3=3s.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.WaitFor own_sp >= 0 3
nf.WaitFor own_dead 90
nf.Expect own_flag == none
nf.Expect own_karma == 0
nf.Expect cp_absorption_matches_received
nf.Expect death_record_matches_fixture
# Total budget >= sum of the derived per-step timeouts plus30s exit grace.
nf.Within 153
